<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended August 24 totalled 133.588 million, versus a revised 131.714 million in the previous week and 130.139 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 166.337 million, versus a revised 165.444 million the previous week and 163.456 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
